  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><span>如果你在玩「</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><span><span>Epic Fight</span></span></span></span></a><span><span><span><span>」模組時想赤手空拳戰鬥，你會喜歡這個模組。</span></span></span></span><br><span><span><span><span>它提供了四種拳套：鐵質、金質、鑽石質和非金質。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>預覽<br></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>鐵質</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dmhmjRv.png\"><br></span></span></span></span></strong>金質<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BZSK0av.png\"><br>鑽石質<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AYQjZVQ.png\"><br>獄髓質<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6eMnXzY.png\"><br><strong>合成配方</strong><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OSl3cJ6.png\"></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hwJA0Kk.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uv27u9T.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IXj048h.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>安裝方式</strong><br>1. 安裝「<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>」模組<br>2. 將主檔案放入「mods」資料夾</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><strong><span><span><span><span>後記</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p>這個模組原本是為我自己製作的，我本來沒打算上傳，因為我很懶得維護並為其他版本製作。但我還是上傳了，不過不會提供支援。<br>我是用 MCreator 製作的，既然不會有後續支援，任何人都可以拿去使用。你也可以從這個模組中提取模型自行運用。但請標明我是原作者。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
